### Uji API pakai ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" (atau salin ke Postman)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = isi_token_dari_login

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@mail.com", "password": "user123" }

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Siti", "email": "siti@mail.com", "password": "rahasia1", "phone": "08123456789" }

### Profil saya
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daftar hotel (filter opsional)
GET {{base}}/hotels?city=Surabaya&guests=2&sort=price_asc

### Daftar kota
GET {{base}}/hotels/cities

### Detail hotel + ketersediaan kamar
GET {{base}}/hotels/1?check_in=2026-12-20&check_out=2026-12-22

### Cek ketersediaan 1 tipe kamar
GET {{base}}/rooms/1/availability?check_in=2026-12-20&check_out=2026-12-22

### Buat booking
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "room_id": 1, "check_in": "2026-12-20", "check_out": "2026-12-22", "guests": 2, "rooms": 1, "guest_name": "Budi Santoso", "guest_phone": "081200000002" }

### Pesanan saya
GET {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat tagihan Virtual Account (bank: BCA/BNI/BRI/MANDIRI)
POST {{base}}/bookings/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "va", "bank": "BCA" }

### Atau buat tagihan QRIS
POST {{base}}/bookings/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "qris" }

### Konfirmasi bayar (simulasi) -> status paid + nomor bukti pembayaran
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hotel disukai
GET {{base}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tambah ke disukai
POST {{base}}/hotels/1/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hapus dari disukai
DELETE {{base}}/hotels/1/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Batalkan
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ulasan
POST {{base}}/hotels/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "booking_id": 1, "rating": 5, "comment": "Kamar bersih, staf ramah" }

### [Admin] Statistik (login pakai admin@stayease.id dulu)
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ===== ADMIN (login pakai admin@stayease.id, isi @token dengan token admin) =====

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Semua pesanan (filter opsional)
GET {{base}}/admin/bookings?status=paid&q=Budi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kamar yang terpesan pada tanggal tertentu
GET {{base}}/admin/rooms/booked?date=2026-12-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Semua ulasan
GET {{base}}/admin/reviews?rating=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ulasan saya (login sebagai user)
GET {{base}}/reviews/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
